{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"bc9ca443aafad3ab085b325818ec24ff26108a16b9d5ffd185e0ab0f4b4f85cb","ja":"さらに数日後。\nこの日は、可奈と未来、ふたりのお仕事で……","zh":"几天后。\n\n这一天，是可奈和未来两人的工作……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e5b27e5c93a0f5133f677f2a708333b1aeb75987d774f5c38e7f55719df3e34f","ja":"今日もバッチリだったね！","zh":"今天也表现得很棒呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"51067a029417ca4aaff46a46ee3df25d37b36d5f65af81010d9617366d40cb73","ja":"うん！　それじゃあ、急いで着替えよう！","zh":"嗯！那我们赶紧换衣服吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a8083b2d90ff02b0c33fb6b77983d503c9a6f4db98f1f862bee7e95fc0324901","ja":"……わあっ！？\nな、なんで紬ちゃんと杏奈がここに！？","zh":"……哇！？\n为、为什么紬和杏奈会在这里！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"795fcd241650ca8d917a45ad8a1364f74b5280510721a1a6a3923521729fc810","ja":"待ち伏せです。さあ、今日という今日は逃しませんよ！\nおふたりとも何をしているのか、話してください！","zh":"这是埋伏。来吧，今天说什么也不会让你们逃掉！\n请告诉我，你们两位到底在做什么！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b0a7f0f16c81c28814c53b4221d0b08a1066b1f7ec3108c5a06fdb4faa963799","ja":"杏奈も……紬さんも、\nずっと……気に、なってた……。","zh":"杏奈也……紬小姐也，一直……很在意……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"043f491f08eb5385abb2eea90720558179ed4c267afbd12fab7e8aec9fdc47a3","ja":"あっ……！\n紬さんと杏奈ちゃんに話すの、すっかり忘れてた！","zh":"啊……！\n我完全忘了要跟紬小姐和杏奈说这件事！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"4007eb055bb6459765ef0110464f23879fbdf254c4d98b6962d991acb30ad5a9","ja":"そんなに心配かけちゃってたの！？\nごめんなさい！　最近、ずっとこれを見てたんだ！","zh":"让你这么担心了吗！？\n对不起！最近我一直在看这个！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"f4dac36eb861f3d633f3196a2e7588a122599e07de76dae0a9f717953b78a29d","ja":"ネトスワで限定配信中のドラマ！\nす～っごく面白くてハマっちゃって。オススメだよ！","zh":"正在网播限定配信的电视剧！\n超级有意思，一看就入迷了。推荐哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"da338996ef1d8cfb3ab9c6045d459b63350c1b31e6a4073901b90225b4f942ad","ja":"警察もののドラマ……ですか？","zh":"警察题材的电视剧……吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"7bcc0bc885cf84fed5fcc872f09bd1ee63435173f68c8803fd4c64e623fadba6","ja":"バディ物……設定すごく、面白そう……。","zh":"搭档题材……这个设定感觉很有意思……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"f5c31fdedc56becdc793532ee3b0f28acae7cc2376ec03849c64cf2a8e21ccb8","ja":"はい、とても興味深い……。\n……はっ！","zh":"是的，非常有意思……\n……啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"87c2b5c9f92048cefde1a1b398f9641c1591af38a599af14345e43e4053e0aee","ja":"ですが、他が疎かになってしまっては問題です！\n現に矢吹さんは、忘れ物までしてましたし……。","zh":"但是，如果因此忽略了其他方面，就麻烦了！\n实际上，矢吹小姐还忘了带东西……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"72ffa4579de447e443d4c10168686a2032eb08dc20d6f93a34caed8cefde2fb5","ja":"あっ、台本！？　ありがとうございます！\nうう……なくしてたのも気付いてなかった……。","zh":"啊，剧本！？谢谢您！\n呜呜……我都没发现剧本不见了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"013cacd230f7a848f17a5a8ac0d416ecc29d9e8a43ea331f0ec9aadddf8f7c04","ja":"あれっ、私もなにか忘れてたような……。\nああっ！　明日提出の宿題、全然やってない！","zh":"咦，我好像也忘了什么……  \n啊！明天要交的作业，我完全没做！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"0abefe0ac28cccacfd1915aefa01a961be86c4be1ede5c28154f70b9d204e957","ja":"あっ、私も！　……はあ、ネットドラマ、\n見る時間減らさないとダメみたいだね……。","zh":"啊，我也是！……唉，看来得减少看网络剧的时间了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[56].text","source_sha256":"6203f0e7daa0ce857480dc94c69ee3b658b091e4de80638e421d8ff62f80ce93","ja":"分かっていただけて、よかったです。\n待ち伏せ作戦、成功ですね。望月さん。","zh":"您能明白就好。\n看来埋伏作战成功了呢，望月小姐。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"cfbba1f2ac6a34e947e0f688895bb003c0e2a01cc6ff523469657837804b389f","ja":"……望月さん、どうしました？","zh":"……望月小姐，怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[59].text","source_sha256":"7263a7095936f45ce1228cfa1d9e91559755c9231340e37f2429a4cac669816b","ja":"えっ……う、うん。そうだね。","zh":"诶……嗯、嗯。是啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1800.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"bc01f8db46f5183bc53ae38e29ce0272df86c1b232dfa202a4b1102fb1252708","ja":"（杏奈も……宿題、忘れてた……。\nドラマも、ゲームも……ハマりすぎは、要注意……）","zh":"（杏奈也……忘了写作业……\n电视剧和游戏……沉迷过头的话，要多加注意……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
